   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Buckingham Greenv**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Don't Sweat It**: back after 65 archived shows (529 days) [4]\n- **All of My Love (led zeppelin cover)**: rare: 9 archived performances [4]\n- **Black Jack tease**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Deez Nutz**: back after 127 archived shows (1171 days); rare: 4 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2003-09-30.reworked** (recommended): source not stated; 30 songs; 174 min [1]. Said about its sound: Original files were too loud and every song clipped; the reworked version is normalized to 98 dB and sounds good [1]\n- **ween2003-09-30.MK4.1644**: source not stated; 29 songs; 174 min [2]. Said about its sound: Quiet passages have some shaking, caused by the mic stand sitting on the venue's spring-loaded floor; Deez Nuts has a tape error near 0:19 and a balloon mic bump around 2:09, both smoothed with crossfades [2]\n- **ween2003-09-30**: source not stated; 30 songs; 174 min [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2003-09-30.reworked**: taped by unknown; source: AKG 480s [1]. Also: This reworked edition moved song start and end points; the edit was done by aangen [1]\n- **ween2003-09-30.MK4.1644**: taped by Fireball; transferred by Fireball; source: Schoeps MK4's > Billbox Preamp > Sony M1 > DAT Master (44.1kHz/16 bit) [2]. Also: Fireball master field recording, provided as a 44.1kHz/16-bit file set [2]\n- **ween2003-09-30**: taped by unknown; source: AKG 480s [3]",
